cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this work, please cite as below."
title: "Organizational Compliance Capacity Under Continuous Normative Change"
subtitle: "A model and methodology, with the Knowledge Currency Budget as the per-regime accounting unit"
version: "0.1"
date-released: "2026-04-28"
url: "https://github.com/systematicreasoning/compliance-burden-index"
repository-code: "https://github.com/systematicreasoning/compliance-burden-index"
authors:
  - family-names: "Hurst"
    given-names: "Ryan"
    affiliation: "Systematic Reasoning, Inc."
abstract: >-
  A model and methodology for measuring organizational compliance capacity
  under continuous normative change in regimes with versioned and continuously-
  communicated normative requirements. Uses the CA/Browser Forum stack
  (TLS BR, S/MIME BR, NetSec, Code Signing BR, EV Guidelines) as the
  principal measurement substrate, with 380 fully-classified per-section
  change records.
